          ],
          "suggestions": []
        },
        {
          "statement": "Statistical rigor is inherent in the theoretical derivation of high-probability bounds, as the paper correctly uses concentration inequalities and Rademacher complexity to establish these bounds, which is the appropriate statistical framework for this type of theoretical work.",
