          "statement": "The combination of the two-level distribution framework with the small-ball method for unbounded losses is a creative and well-justified synthesis of existing techniques, enabling the analysis of generalization in scenarios where both heterogeneity and heavy-tailedness are present.",
          "source_roles": [
